~ start
Wisowl: [[Hi|Hello|Good morning]], welcome to Bloomrise!
Wisowl: I'm Wisowl, your guide and companion on this journey.
Wisowl: Before you start, would you like a quick tutorial?
- Yes, please. => tutorial
- No, I already know everything. => skip_tutorial

~ skip_tutorial
Wisowl: Oh, confident one! Good luck then. 🌟
@mutation tool_pickaxe
@mutation tool_axe
@mutation tool_tiller
@mutation tool_watering_can
@mutation rose_seeds
=> END

~ tutorial
Wisowl: Great! Let's begin your adventure!
Wisowl: First, let's learn to gather some basic resources. 🪨🌳
@mutation tool_pickaxe
@mutation tool_axe
Wisowl: I just gave you a Pickaxe and an Axe!
Wisowl: To use any tool, select it on your toolbar using Left Mouse Button (LMB), then click on the world with LMB to use it.
Wisowl: Look around — you will find stones and trees to gather materials from.
Wisowl: Stones and wood are valuable resources — you can sell them to earn coins! 🪙
Wisowl: Once you feel ready, come back to me.
=> pause

~ pause
Wisowl: Ready to continue?
- Yes, next! => inventory_tip
- I need a moment. => wait_more

~ wait_more
Wisowl: Take your time. Come back when you're ready.
=> pause

~ inventory_tip
Wisowl: Now let's learn about your inventory! 🎒
Wisowl: Press E to open your Inventory. You can see there your collected stones and logs.
Wisowl: To move an item to your toolbar, click it with LMB.
Wisowl: To throw an item away, right-click it (PPM).
Wisowl: If you want to move an item back from the toolbar into your inventory, right-click it again (PPM).
Wisowl: Remember — Toolbar items are only your tools and seeds!

Wisowl: Also, in your house you will find a Chest! 🏠
Wisowl: It works just like your inventory — but to move items to or from the chest, hold Shift while clicking.


Wisowl: Ready to move on?
- Let's plant something! => planting
- Maybe later. => end_conversation

~ planting
Wisowl: Great! You need to prepare the soil first.
@mutation tool_tiller
@mutation rose_seeds
Wisowl: I've given you a Tiller. Use it to till the ground and get it ready for planting.
Wisowl: After that, plant seeds, water them daily, and soon they will grow!

Wisowl: Would you like a tip on watering your crops?
- Yes, please! => watering
- No, I'm good. => end_conversation

~ watering
Wisowl: Here's a Watering Can! 🌱💧
@mutation tool_watering_can
Wisowl: Water your plants every day to keep them healthy and help them grow strong.


Wisowl: Lastly — if you follow the road leading from your farm, you will reach a Shop. 🛒
Wisowl: There, you can sell items you collect and buy new seeds to grow more plants!
=> end_conversation

~ end_conversation
Wisowl: That's all I can teach you for now.
Wisowl: Good luck, Bloomseeker! 🌟
Wisowl: Your journey in Bloomrise begins!
=> END
